
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "aboutus";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
@section metatags{
    <title>About FaresChoices | Search Cheap Flight Deals</title>
    <meta name="description" content="At FaresChoices, our mission is to provide affordable travel options, and we help you find the best flight deals, including one-way and round-trip flights." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.fareschoices.com/about-us" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="About FaresChoices | Search Cheap Flight Deals" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.fareschoices.com/images/logo.png" />
    <meta name="og:locale" content="en_US" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="fareschoices" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="At FaresChoices, our mission is to provide affordable travel options, and we help you find the best flight deals, including one-way and round-trip flights." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.fareschoices.com/about-us" />
    <meta name="author" content="fareschoices.com" />
    <meta name="geo.region" content="US-GA" />
    <meta name="language" content="English" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="fareschoices" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="About FaresChoices | Search Cheap Flight Deals" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="At FaresChoices, our mission is to provide affordable travel options, and we help you find the best flight deals, including one-way and round-trip flights." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.fareschoices.com/images/logo.png" />





}

<div class="container BannerBg">
    <div class="innervootbg">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="column">
                <h1>About US - Fares Choices</h1>
                @{Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Shared/_SearchEngine.cshtml");}
               
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="column">
            <p>Fareschoices is a leading portal to find the best price of air tickets and explore the deals for the flight booking. Fareschoices.com was created to make air travel information simple and easy to understand.</p>
            <p>We know that searching for flights can feel confusing. There are too many websites, too many prices, and too many rules. Our goal is to break this confusion and help travelers make better choices.</p>
            <h2>Why Fareschoices.com Exists</h2>
            <p>Many travel websites focus only on selling tickets. We focus on explaining travel.</p>
            <p><b>Fareschoices.com is built for people who want:</b></p>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Clear information before booking</li>
                <li>Honest travel guidance</li>
                <li>Easy explanations without complicated words</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We believe travelers should understand their options before spending money.</p>
            <h2>What We Do?</h2>
            <p>At Fareschoices.com, we:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;gap: 0;">
                <li>Share flight and airfare-related information</li>
                <li>Explain airlines, airports, and travel routes</li>
                <li>Help users understand fare trends and booking tips</li>
                <li>Publish helpful travel guides in simple language</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We do not sell tickets. We help you decide better.</p>
            <h2>Our Approach</h2>
            <p><b>We keep things:</b></p>
            <p>Simple</p>
            <p>Honest</p>
            <p>Easy to read</p>
            <p>No confusing terms. No unnecessary promises.</p>
            <p>Just clear information that a normal person can understand.</p>
            <p>Every article is written with the traveler in mind — someone planning a trip, comparing options, or just looking for clarity.</p>
            <p>Independent & Unbiased</p>
            <p>Fareschoices.com is an independent travel information website.</p>
            <p>We are not owned by any airline.</p>
            <p>We are not controlled by any booking company.</p>
            <p>This allows us to share information freely, without pushing anyone to buy.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

